  "text": "SKIP TO CONTENT\naitezaz\ndev\nsikandar\nABOUT\nABOUT\nSERVICES\nSERVICES\nWORK\nWORK\nCONTACT\nCONTACT\nAITEZAZ\nsikandar\nAVAILABLE FOR WORK • LET'S BUILD •\n\nFull-stack engineer building fast, scalable, and reliable web applications.\n\nMERN STACK DEVELOPER\nOPEN TO WORK WORLDWIDE\nPROJECTS\nVIEW WORK →\nCONTACT\nGET IN TOUCH →\nRESUME\nDOWNLOAD →\nWHO\nam\nI?\n\nI\nam\na\nsoftware\nengineer\ndriven\nby\na\npassion\nfor\nbuilding\nclean,\nintuitive,\nand\nreliable\ndigital\nexperiences.\n\n(ABOUT ME)\n\nI\nbuild\nweb\napplications\nthat\nbridge\nthoughtful\nfrontend\ninterfaces\nwith\nrobust\nbackend\nsystems.\nTo\nme,\nsoftware\nis\nmore\nthan\ncode\non\na\nscreen;\nit\nis\nabout\nmaking\ntechnology\nfeel\neffortless\nand\ngenuinely\nuseful\nto\nreal\npeople.\n\nMy\njourney\nbegan\nwith\na\nsimple\ncuriosity\nfor\nhow\nthings\nwork\nunder\nthe\nhood.\nOver\ntime,\nthat\ncuriosity\nevolved\ninto\na\ngenuine\npassion\nfor\nfluid\ninterface\nanimations,\nreliable\nbackend\narchitecture,\nand\nbuilding\nuser\njourneys\nthat\nfeel\neffortless\nand\nalive.\n\nWhether\nI\nam\npolishing\nmicro-interactions\nor\nengineering\nfull-stack\nsystems,\nmy\ncore\nfocus\nremains\nunchanged:\ncreating\nsoftware\nthat\nbrings\npeople\njoy,\nsolves\nreal\nproblems,\nand\nleaves\na\nlasting\npositive\nimpact.\n\n(EXPERIENCE)\nTHE\n \npath\n \nSO FAR.\n2026\nINDUSTRY\nSOFTWARE ENGINEER INTERN - MERN STACK\n\ne-strats, Islamabad\n\n2026\nRECOGNITION\nHEC NATIONAL SKILLS COMPETENCY TEST (NSCT)\n\nHEC, PSEB & P@SHA\n\n95th Percentile, Top 5% nationwide\n\n2024-25\nCERTIFICATION\nWEB AND MOBILE APP DEVELOPMENT\n\nSaylani Mass IT Training (SMIT), Peshawar\n\nFull-Stack MERN, TypeScript, Next.js & Hybrid Apps\n\n2022-26\nEDUCATION\nBS COMPUTER SCIENCE\n\nUniversity of Peshawar\n\n3.60 / 4.00 GPA\n\nWHAT\ni\nDO\n(SERVICES)\n\nI\nspecialize\nin\nbuilding\nfull-stack\nweb\napplications\nthat\nare\nfast,\nreliable,\nand\nuser-friendly.\nWith\na\nsolid\nfoundation\nin\nboth\nfrontend\nand\nbackend\ntechnologies,\nI\nhelp\nbring\nideas\nto\nlife\nwhether\nit's\nfor\na\nbusiness,\na\nstartup,\nor\na\nproduct\nteam.\n\nFull Stack Development\n\nEnd-to-end\ndevelopment\nof\nmodern\nweb\napplications,\ncovering\neverything\nfrom\nfrontend\ninterfaces\nto\nbackend\nAPIs.\nI\nbuild\ncomplete,\nmaintainable,\nand\nscalable\nsystems\nusing\nthe\nMERN\nstack\nand\nmodern\ntooling.\n\n01\nMERN Stack (MongoDB, Express.js, React, Node.js)\n02\nREST APIs & Integration\n03\nAuthentication & Authorization\nFrontend Development\n\nCrafting\nresponsive,\naccessible,\nand\nelegant\ninterfaces\nthat\ndeliver\nexceptional\nuser\nexperiences.\nI\nfocus\non\nclarity,\nperformance,\nand\nseamless\ninteraction\nacross\ndevices.\n\n01\nReact, Next.js, TailwindCSS, GSAP\n02\nOptimized Rendering & Animations\n03\nFigma to Code Implementation\nOptimization & Performance\n\nOptimizing\ncodebases,\nAPIs,\nand\nassets\nfor\nspeed,\nscalability,\nand\nmaintainability.\nI\nensure\nyour\napplications\nrun\nefficiently\nwith\nbest\npractices\nin\ncaching,\nSEO,\nand\ndeployment.\n\n01\nPerformance Tuning & Code Refactoring\n02\nSEO & Accessibility Optimization\n03\nDeployment (Vercel, AWS, Docker)\nMY\nTECH\nstack\n\nA\nselection\nof\ntechnologies\nI\nuse\nto\ndesign,\nbuild,\nand\ndeploy\nfull-stack\nweb\napplications.\n\nAll Categories\nFrontend\nBackend & Real-Time\nDatabase & ORM\nDevOps & Cloud\nAI, Testing & Tools\nFRONTEND\n8 TECHNOLOGIES\n\nJavaScript\n\nTypeScript\n\nReact\n\nNext.js\n\nRedux Toolkit\n\nTailwind CSS\n\nBootstrap\n\nGSAP\n\nBACKEND & REAL-TIME\n4 TECHNOLOGIES\n\nNode.js\n\nExpress.js\n\nSocket.io\n\nFirebase\n\nDATABASE & ORM\n3 TECHNOLOGIES\n\nMongoDB\n\nMongoose\n\nMySQL\n\nDEVOPS & CLOUD\n5 TECHNOLOGIES\n\nDocker\n\nGitHub Actions\n\nAWS\n\nNginx\n\nLinux\n\nAI, TESTING & TOOLS\n8 TECHNOLOGIES\n\nGemini AI\n\nJest\n\nZod\n\nStripe\n\nCloudinary\n\nGit\n\nPostman\n\nFigma\n\nSELECTED\nworks\n01\n→\nCOLLABORATIVE STUDY PLATFORM\nCOLLABORATIVE STUDY PLATFORM\nReact 19\nNode.js\nExpress 5\nSocket.io\nMongoDB\nLibreOffice\npdfjs-dist\nCloudinary\nFirebase\nGroq\nGoogle Gemini\nVIEW PROJECT\n→\n02\n→\nHOSPITAL MANAGEMENT SYSTEM\nHOSPITAL MANAGEMENT SYSTEM\nReact 19\nVite\nNode.js\nExpress 5\nMongoDB\nMongoose\nGoogle Gemini\nRedux Toolkit\nTailwind CSS\nAnt Design\nNodemailer\nVIEW PROJECT\n→\n03\n→\nE-COMMERCE STORE\nE-COMMERCE STORE\nNext.js 16\nReact 19\nTypeScript\nTailwind CSS\nRedux Toolkit\nStripe\nMongoDB\nMongoose\nZod\nVIEW PROJECT\n→\n04\n→\nPERSONAL FINANCE TRACKER\nPERSONAL FINANCE TRACKER\nReact 19\nVite\nTailwind CSS\nRedux Toolkit\nRecharts\nNode.js\nExpress\nMongoDB\nMongoose\nJWT\nVIEW PROJECT\n→\n05\n→\nMODERN BLOG SPACE\nMODERN BLOG SPACE\nReact 19\nVite\nTailwind CSS\nRedux Toolkit\nReact Router\nNode.js\nExpress\nMongoDB\nCloudinary\nDocker\nAWS EC2\nVIEW PROJECT\n→\nAVAILABLE FOR WORK\n◆\nOPEN TO OPPORTUNITIES\n◆\nLET'S BUILD\n◆\nMERN STACK\n◆\nAVAILABLE FOR WORK\n◆\nOPEN TO OPPORTUNITIES\n◆\nLET'S BUILD\n◆\nMERN STACK\n◆\nAVAILABLE FOR WORK\n◆\nOPEN TO OPPORTUNITIES\n◆\nLET'S BUILD\n◆\nMERN STACK\n◆\nAVAILABLE FOR WORK\n◆\nOPEN TO OPPORTUNITIES\n◆\nLET'S BUILD\n◆\nMERN STACK\n◆\nAVAILABLE FOR WORK\n◆\nOPEN TO OPPORTUNITIES\n◆\nLET'S BUILD\n◆\nMERN STACK\n◆\nAVAILABLE FOR WORK\n◆\nOPEN TO OPPORTUNITIES\n◆\nLET'S BUILD\n◆\nMERN STACK\n◆\nAVAILABLE FOR WORK\n◆\nOPEN TO OPPORTUNITIES\n◆\nLET'S BUILD\n◆\nMERN STACK\n◆\nAVAILABLE FOR WORK\n◆\nOPEN TO OPPORTUNITIES\n◆\nLET'S BUILD\n◆\nMERN STACK\n◆\nLET'S\ntalk\n\nHave\na\nproject\nin\nmind\nor\njust\nwant\nto\nsay\nhello?\nFeel\nfree\nto\nreach\nout.\n\nYour Name *\nYour Email *\nMessage *\n\n0 / 30 minimum characters\n\nSEND MESSAGE\nPROCEED →\n\nDIRECT CONTACT\n\nAITEZAZSIKANDAR@GMAIL.COM\nCLICK TO COPY EMAIL ADDRESS\n✓ COPIED TO CLIPBOARD\nMenu\nABOUT\nABOUT\nSERVICES\nSERVICES\nWORK\nWORK\nCONTACT\nCONTACT\nSocials\nLINKEDIN\nLINKEDIN\nINSTAGRAM\nINSTAGRAM\nGITHUB\nGITHUB\nSOURCE CODE\nSOURCE CODE\nLocal Time\n\nLoading local time...",
